title Cassette bound (mono 48 kHz card): FLAC chosen from the Codec picker, the Settings row says FLAC, the picker shows it selected (dot, darker row)
sizes 480x320 320x480 640x480
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO 1
env CASSETTE_DEMO_HOME demo-home
env CASSETTE_DEMO_CARD plain
env CASSETTE_DEMO_CODECS both
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 1500
key s
wait 500
key down
key down
key enter
wait 500
key down
key enter
wait 500
expect text "FLAC"
shot settings-flac
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
key down
key down
key enter
wait 500
shot picker-current-flac
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
